# ApeCoin Smart Contract Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for ApeCoin.

ApeCoin is one of the most recognizable consumer crypto and NFT ecosystem tokens. This makes the folder a useful historical reference for Softstack’s work on high visibility token contracts connected to large NFT and Web3 communities.

## Audit Information

Project: ApeCoin  
Audit type: Token smart contract audit and certificate  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

