## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed smart contract security work for a widely recognized token in the NFT and consumer Web3 ecosystem.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s token smart contract audit work connected to a high visibility Web3 brand.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
